# Copy to .env and set the backend's address (https://, or http:// for a PC on your network). It is the only place
# the app gets it from: the Android app and `npm run build` call this server, and build-apk.bat refuses to build
# without it. `npm run dev` ignores it and forwards /api to BACKEND_URL (default http://127.0.0.1:8000), so
# development never writes into the real books.
VITE_API_URL=
